## Overview

This is a **NestJS + TypeORM + SQLite** assignment to implement slot conflict detection. The scaffold (entities, DTOs, controller, seed data, e2e tests) is complete, but **`SlotsService` is stubbed** — no real conflict logic exists yet. Times use **`start` / `end`** (not `stop`).

