## Data Model Summary

```
Resources (id, name)
    │
    ├── Slots (id, name, start, end, resource_id)
    │
BlockingDependencies (id, blocking_resource_id, blocked_resource_id)
```

**Seeded dependency graph** (`seed-data.ts`):

```
Pool ──blocks──▶ Lane 1, Lane 2, Lane 3, Lane 4
Lane 3 ──blocks──▶ Lane 2
Lane 2 ──blocks──▶ Lane 3
```

**Overlap rule** (`REQUIREMENTS.md`):

```
slotA.start < slotB.end AND slotA.end > slotB.start
```

Adjacent/touching slots (`end === other.start`) do **not** conflict.

**Conflict check scope** for a slot on resource R:
1. Same resource R (direct overlap)
2. Any resource that **blocks** R (upstream blockers only — one-directional)

