## How Slots Are Loaded / Stored

| Operation | Mechanism |
|-----------|-----------|
| **Read** | `EntityManager.find(Slot)` in service |
| **Create** | `EntityManager.save(Slot.create({...}))` — no conflict check |
| **Update** | `EntityManager.findOneOrFail` + mutate `start`/`end` + save |
| **Seed** | `seed.ts` clears tables, inserts from `seed-data.ts` |
| **Startup** | `main.ts` calls `seed()` before app boot |
| **Tests** | `beforeAll` calls `seed()`, then boots Nest app with same SQLite file |

No custom repository classes. `BlockingDependency` is registered in `SlotsModule` but **not queried** by the service yet.

