## Tests — Patterns & Coverage

**Single test file:** `/Users/guestaccount/Documents/GitHub/bond-assignment/server/test/slots.e2e-spec.ts`  
**No unit tests** (`*.spec.ts` under `src/` — none exist).

**Test setup pattern:**
- `seed()` before all tests
- Nest e2e app with `SlotsModule` + TypeORM pointing at `bond.sqlite`
- Resolve resource IDs by name (`Pool`, `Lane 1`, etc.)
- Helper `dt('HH:mm:ss')` builds today's datetime strings

**GET /slots tests verify:**
- One entry per resource (5 resources)
- Slot shape includes `conflicts[]`
- At least one slot has conflicts
- Pool slots appear in Lane 1 entry; Lane 1 slots do NOT appear in Pool entry
- Pool slot listed as conflict on overlapping Lane 1 slot
- Lane 1 slots NOT listed as conflicts on Pool slots
- Conflicts only from same resource or blocking resources
- Lane 4 (no own slots) still gets an entry with Pool blocker slots

**POST /slots tests verify:**
- 201 when no conflict
- 409 + array of conflicting slots when overlap exists
- Adjacent (touching) slots allowed
- Cross-resource 409 includes Pool conflicts when booking Lane 1

**PUT /slots/:slotId tests verify:**
- 200 on conflict-free update
- 409 when new times conflict
- Self-exclusion (updating to same times succeeds)
- 404 for missing slot

